# Saved web pages kept locally for reference while wiring up the Meta pixel.
# They are NOT source, and they must not be published: this repository is
# public, and a page saved from a logged-in Facebook session carries whatever
# that session had in it. "Events Manager.html" contains EAA-prefixed strings
# 200 and 219 characters long, which is exactly the shape of a Meta access
# token. Neither file has ever been pushed — keep it that way.
